          "code": "let owner = String::from(\"ada\");\nlet renamed = rename(owner);   // owner moves here\n// println!(\"{owner}\");        // would not compile\n\nlet cents = 100;               // i64 is Copy\nlet copy = cents;              // cents is still usable"
